# Database Setup Onboarding

When working on a fresh clone or unconfigured `.env.local`:
1. Ask the user:
   - **[1] Supabase Cloud (Managed PostgreSQL)**
   - **[2] Self-Hosted Local PostgreSQL / Docker (Local-first)**
2. Follow the detailed protocol in `skills/database-setup/SKILL.md` or run `npm run setup`.
